{"id":8867097346247,"title":"Dragonfly Couple Quilt Set, Dragonflies Patchwork Style Quilt Set","handle":"dragonfly-couple-quilt-set-dragonflies-patchwork-style-quilt-set","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace rustic elegance with the Jeminise Farmhouse Quilt Set, designed to bring a touch of countryside charm and warmth to any bedroom. This beautiful quilt set is perfect for adding a cozy, timeless look to your home, making it an ideal gift for loved ones or a delightful addition to your own bedding collection.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRustic Elegance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features classic patterns and soft, natural fabrics for a cozy, timeless farmhouse look.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMeaningful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e An absolutely perfect choice for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved ones.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to fit various bed sizes.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e Comes with 1 Quilt, with an option to add 2 Pillowcases.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your quilt by adding a name and selecting your preferred size.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable in cold water and can be air dried without heat for easy maintenance.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e Made from microfiber and polycotton for a soft and comfortable feel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\